From 694815f379853fada6e2e98d553eb418a7ac1c1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Panteleev <git@cy.md>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:14:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(microsoft): Graph calendar: time zones, relative
 patterns, transaction ids and cancelling

Times are taken in Windows' and IANA's time zones (CLDR's mapping), and a
series expanded in its own, across daylight saving time;
relativeMonthly and relativeYearly patterns expand; a transactionId
makes creating an event idempotent; an organizer cancels a meeting, or
one occurrence of it.
